com/apache/airflow/issues/69599#issuecomment-4917319186","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/69599","id":4917319186,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAgUK288AAAABJRhWEg","user":{"login":"jroachgolf84","id":116606359,"node_id":"U_kgDOBvNFlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/116606359?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jroachgolf84","html_url":"https://github.com/jroachgolf84","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jroachgolf84/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jroachgolf84/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jroachgolf84/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jroachgolf84/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jroachgolf84/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jroachgolf84/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jroachgolf84/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jroachgolf84/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jroachgolf84/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-08T17:11:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T17:11:10Z","body":"I think there are some questions to be answered:\n\n- What happens if you pause mid-run. Should the operation going on behind the scenes continue to execute? Should it fail?\n- When you un-pause, where does it pick up? Does it start over?\n\nResumable Operators are definitely something to think about here.","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/4917319186/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jroachgolf84","id":116606359,"node_id":"U_kgDOBvNFlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1166063