ed","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-07-08T17:11:17Z","label":{"name":"needs-triage","color":"b60205"},"intent":null,"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/4917384456","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/issues/69599#issuecomment-4917384456","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/69599","id":4917384456,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAgUK288AAAABJRlVCA","user":{"login":"wzhpor","id":217699870,"node_id":"U_kgDODPnWHg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217699870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wzhpor","html_url":"https://github.com/wzhpor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wzhpor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wzhpor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wzhpor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wzhpor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wzhpor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wzhpor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wzhpor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wzhpor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wzhpor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-08T17:19:09Z","updated_at":"2026-07-08T17:25:45Z","body":"I ammended my original propsal with narrow the scope:\n\n**1. Pausing mid-run:** I'd drop that from the initial proposal. Pause would only apply to tasks that are **not yet running** (`scheduled` / `queued`, and possibly `deferred`). If an operator realises too late, they can still pause downstream tasks to hold the workflow.\n\nOptionally, we could allow pausing a `running` task with an explicit choice: either kill the running process (same as manual fail) or let it finish but discard its result and keep the state as `paused`. I'd leave that for a follow-up.\n\n**2. Resume behaviour:** Mirror the \"clear task\" flow exactly — on resume, state goes `paused` → `scheduled` and the scheduler picks it up. `try_number` increments, task runs from the start. No attempt at mid-execution resumption; that's the operator's responsibility (idempotency, deferrable operators, etc.).\n\nThe goal is operational transparency: a distinct state and audit trail (`paused_by`, `pause_reason`) instead of overloading `failed` + `clear` for planned holds.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/4917384456/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"wzhpor","id":217699870,"node_id":"U_kgDODPnWHg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/217699870?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wzhpor","html_url":"https://github.com/wzhpor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wzhpor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wzhpor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wzhpor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wzhpor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wzhpor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wzhpor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wzhpor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wzhpor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wzhpor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":27747480057,"node_id":"SE_lADOAgUK288AAAABIDfIqM8AAAAGdeDx-Q","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/events/27747480057","actor":{"login":"tirkarthi","id":3972343,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NzIzNDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3972343?